	(text "LEDS: four motion LEDs, REC, RANGE (on = -5..+5 V).\n10k: 0.33 mA at full duty, dimmed further by PWM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 168.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "40efb511-2e43-5d73-82f4-9e7102a618b2")
	)
	(text "KNOBS 1-4: 50k linear dividers +5V..GND into PA1 / PA2 / PA6 / PA7, 10n at each pin.\nIdle = plays the take, shifted up / down by the knob; REC held = the knob is recorded."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.54 104.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "528cb9f3-6569-5f2e-9980-bd6a71f5cf26")
	)
	(text "U5 supply: +/-12V_F, 100n each."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "70db5457-eb68-5566-bca3-13902aa84567")
	)
	(text "OUTPUTS 1-4: DAC -> 10k / 100n (160 Hz) -> TL074, gain 2 around +5VA: Vout = 2 x Vdac - (+5VA).\nCode 0 = -5 V, 2048 = 0 V, 4095 = +5 V. RANGE is firmware only: 0..+5 V uses codes 2048..4095\n(2.4 mV steps), -5..+5 V uses 0..4095. 1k series to the jack, DC coupled."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "857ecfa5-c026-5e4d-aa56-d45a77483f0b")
	)
	(text "BUTTONS: REC (hold + move a knob = record that knob;\nhold 5 s without moving a knob = erase every take), RANGE (click)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 161.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8e128e0c-b65c-54d7-9862-d9a2721acd6a")
	)
	(text "I2C: MB85RC256V FRAM 0x50 (takes: 2 bytes x 50 frames/s, ~81 s per knob, always saved)\nand MCP4728 quad 12-bit DAC 0x60 (VREF = VDD = +5VA, LDAC low). 2.2k pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.3 161.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9c57af45-0e71-5502-bd66-96b7dc4feb08")
	)
	(text "POWER: +12V -> B5819W -> +12V_F (U5 V+, HT7550-1 -> +5V); -12V -> B5819W -> -12V_F (U5 V-).\n+5V -> R1 10R / C6 -> +5VA: DAC supply = DAC reference, and the output-stage offset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c57f3201-dff8-5c44-9fbc-b91354972363")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR MOTION - S1 schematic (4-knob motion recorder, 4 CV outs, 6HP). Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cbe58370-8474-59ff-a0f5-cbabbf172a59")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: #FLG01/#FLG04/#FLG05 mark the Eurorack GND/-12V/+12V entry at J5; #FLG02/#FLG03 mark the\nprotected rails behind D7/D8 and #FLG06 marks +5VA behind R1, which ERC cannot see through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 82.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e13bfa22-13e7-5ce2-a3cc-ff9e59a03cec")
	)
	(text "MCU: ATtiny1616 at 5 V, 20 MHz. Knobs PA1/PA2/PA6/PA7 (ADC0). I2C PB0 SCL / PB1 SDA (TWI0, 400 kHz).\nLEDs on TCA0 split PWM: PB2 WO2, PA3 WO3, PA4 WO4, PA5 WO5; PB3 WO0 and PB4 WO1 via PORTMUX.\nButtons PC0 / PC1 (internal pull-ups). Spare: PB5, PC2, PC3. UPDI J6: pin 1 UPDI, pin 2 GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 92.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e81cc5df-ec76-5108-9d72-4a418db36b62")
	)
